{"metadata":{"name":"Muwatta Malik","section":{"54":"General Subjects"},"section_detail":{"54":{"hadithnumber_first":1763,"hadithnumber_last":1807,"arabicnumber_first":1763,"arabicnumber_last":1807,"name_native":"مواضيع عامة"}}},"hadiths":[{"hadithnumber":1804,"arabicnumber":1804,"text":"وحدثني مالك، انه بلغه ان عمر بن الخطاب، كان يذهب الى العوالي كل يوم سبت فاذا وجد عبدا في عمل لا يطيقه وضع عنه منه","grades":[{"name":"Salim al-Hilali","grade":"Mauquf Daif"}],"reference":{"book":54,"hadith":42}}]}